---
import Layout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About William Sutton | William64.com"
  description="A self-taught developer, creative curator, and lifelong learner. A little context behind the projects and rabbit holes."
>
  <PageHeader
    title="Curiosity is the common thread."
    eyebrow="About William"
    description="I’m William Sutton—a self-taught developer, creative curator, and builder. Code is one way I explore the things that interest me, but it’s never the whole story."
  />
  <div class="split">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>A bit of background</h2>
      <p>
        I’ve been coding for over ten years. I started out of curiosity, and
        that’s still what keeps me building: understanding a system, making
        something useful, or following an idea far enough to see where it leads.
      </p>
      <p>
        I collect interesting people, projects, tools, and ideas across a wide
        range of nerdy domains, then connect them to the people who might love
        them next. When I’m not building, I’m usually learning, exploring, or
        following a promising rabbit hole.
      </p>
      <h2>The learning journey</h2>
      <ol class="timeline">
        <li>
          <span class="meta">2014 — Present</span><h3>
            Learning by building
          </h3><p>
            Self-taught development with modern web technologies, open-source
            tools, and an ongoing interest in clean code, performance, and
            accessibility.
          </p>
        </li><li>
          <span class="meta">2012 — 2014</span><h3>The first steps</h3><p>
            Starting with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript basics.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <h2>A second voice</h2><p>
        Aaron is my AI assistant. He has a corner of this site for process logs,
        experiments, and occasional oddities. His writing is labeled separately
        from the human-authored notebook.
      </p><p><a href="/aaron/">Meet Aaron →</a></p>
    </div>
    <aside class="stack">
      <section class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">The toolkit</p><h2>What I work with</h2><p
          class="small"
        >
          JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, HTML, and CSS.
        </p><p class="small">
          React, Astro, and Node.js; Git, VS Code, and Docker.
        </p><p class="small">
          The tool depends on the problem. The aim is to keep learning and build
          things that make sense.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p><h2>Compare notes.</h2><p
          class="small"
        >
          I’m happy to connect with curious people, creators, builders, and
          fellow nerds.
        </p><div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:suttonwilliamd@gmail.com"
            >Email me ↗</a
          ><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/suttonwilliamd"
            >GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Layout>
